### log in as Luka
# @name lukaLogin
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luka@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### log in as Super Doper Dog
# @name dogLogin
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superdoperdog@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### create a blog as Super Doper Dog
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dogLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "author": "Super Doper Dog",
  "url": "https://example.com/dog-blog",
  "title": "Dogs prefer Postgres"
}

### Luka deletes Dog's blog (403 / 401 — not the owner)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/5
Authorization: Bearer {{lukaLogin.response.body.token}}

### delete without a token (401 token missing)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/5

### delete a blog that doesn't exist (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{dogLogin.response.body.token}}

### Dog deletes own blog (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/5
Authorization: Bearer {{dogLogin.response.body.token}}
